      "entries": [
        "The druid casts one of the following spells, using WIS as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13).<br>At will: druidcraft, speak with animals<br>3/day each: entangle, cure wounds, thunderwave<br>2/day each: barkskin, spike growth"
